                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ви́ллах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3d4b9672-6091-3983-876a-4cf4f1f81823",
                        "entry_id": "85ff3ffc-03ab-3de9-85d2-9a9c8886bc3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "богатая загородная дача или дом-особняк, обычно окружённый садом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f271237-1770-4e0c-9a11-5967034e10d9",
                                "sense_id": "3d4b9672-6091-3983-876a-4cf4f1f81823",
                                "text": "Это была прелестная маленькая вилла на берегу моря, по дороге в Ville Franche, окруженная роскошным садом из апельсиновых и пальмовых деревьев."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fd94c44-9806-4acb-aae1-7d8be20ae80d",
                                "sense_id": "3d4b9672-6091-3983-876a-4cf4f1f81823",
                                "text": "Небольшая, но за крупные деньги нанятая вилла белела, как сахарная, сквозь черноту кипарисов."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d8055f7-76af-4f6f-aa9a-09e9be6b324d",
                                "sense_id": "3d4b9672-6091-3983-876a-4cf4f1f81823",
                                "text": "Белые виллы под черепичными крышами поражают разнообразием архитектуры, обширными, тщательно ухоженными садами."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e16e9389-fa4b-4ed5-a992-6beec8e9a0b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "85ff3ffc-03ab-3de9-85d2-9a9c8886bc3c",
                        "source_sense_id": "3d4b9672-6091-3983-876a-4cf4f1f81823",
                        "target_lang_word": "villa",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "villa",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aeb3968-3478-3dcb-8d23-5d980403fe30",
                                        "entry_id": "473df09a-7729-3d81-bb89-5e4a091222f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A house, often larger and more expensive than average, in the countryside or on the coast, often used as a retreat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eabe1219-576a-4560-9da0-7413e629c671",
                                                "sense_id": "0aeb3968-3478-3dcb-8d23-5d980403fe30",
                                                "text": "This villa was long and low and white, and severe after its manner : for upon and about it were none of those playful ebullitions of taste, such as conical towers, domed roofs, embattlements, statues, coloured tiles and crenellations, such as are dear to architects of villas all the world over."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ef0da29-5871-3613-81fc-2cdbd4e01a5e",
                                        "entry_id": "473df09a-7729-3d81-bb89-5e4a091222f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A family house, often semi-detached in Victorian or Edwardian style, in a middle class street."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcf26cc4-05a3-44a7-a3c7-c5737f51356c",
                                                "sense_id": "4ef0da29-5871-3613-81fc-2cdbd4e01a5e",
                                                "text": "They were just ordinary suburban children, and they lived with their Father and Mother in an ordinary red-brick-fronted villa, with coloured glass in the front door, a tiled passage that was called a hall, a bath-room with hot and cold water, electric bells, French windows, and a good deal of white paint, and 'every modern convenience', as the house-agents say."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd2e77dd-f336-34e0-85d9-8d3bd148344e",
                                        "entry_id": "473df09a-7729-3d81-bb89-5e4a091222f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One’s village or ancestral homeland."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Nigeria",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "villa",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42e1ba24-33d7-3c35-b52d-1d819e1fca3d",
                                        "entry_id": "be06b49a-c243-3498-904d-97ca4e566e89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A country house, with farm buildings around a courtyard."
                                        ],
